  "cyp:paramedic": {t:"Outcome: Paramedic", s:"1.PMsdF2F | 2.GPsdF2F | 3.UCC", x:"Children and Young People \u00a0Mental Health \u00a0suggested outcome: \n1. Paramedic (pts 3+ months)\u00a0 same-day, F2F \n2. GP same-day, F2F \n3. Advise patient to go to an Urgent Care Centre", h:"<h3>Outcome: Paramedic</h3><p><b>Suggested outcome:</b><br>Children and Young People \u00a0Mental Health \u00a0suggested outcome: <br>1. Paramedic (pts 3+ months)\u00a0 same-day, F2F <br>2. GP same-day, F2F <br>3. Advise patient to go to an Urgent Care Centre</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(65, 65, 65); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(65, 168, 95); font-size: 24px;\">If the first outcome is unavailable or patient is reluctant, move to the next option</span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\" id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 24px; font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif;\" id=\"isPasted\">If the patient has been seen twice by any clinician at our surgery for the same or related symptoms (excluding LTCs), book a GP appointment. Always check previous notes - if a GP follow-up is advised, book accordingly, even after just one visit.</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(65, 65, 65); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-al